From b7f44ec31425549b47a894f386f14955f68bd917 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:56:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/19] drm/asahi: M5: InitData for the macOS 27.2 and 27.3
 firmware (#1173)

aurora-silicon/linux #1173 (Rolando Trevino, rolotrealanis98; head
d8ca53c82e52): the G17S InitData layouts and firmware identities of the
macOS 27.2 (26B123) and 27.3 beta 1 (26C5035r) builds, squashed and resolved
against integration/aurora's Graph refactor: each build gets its own Graph
(M5_GRAPH_26B123, M5_GRAPH_26C5035), hw_offset() and the board graph are
kept, and the J813 keeps its board graph.

The 26B123 identity checks out against the IPSW: the J714s identity of
UniversalMac_27.2_26B123 names Firmware/agx/armfw_g17x.im4p and
armfw1_g17x.im4p; their G17S images (LC_UUIDs 6299EB93-B771-3834-89CB-
05410554188F and 28166DD7-1246-3583-A4AE-4B7CFD146DE5), TEXT 0x50000 +
0x54000 with the boot-filled ranges zeroed, hash to 2b4613c6...913f0fd9,
the digest in hw/t6050.rs.

Ported unchanged from betizzel/omarchy-m5 patches/upstream-27.3/0001.

Co-Authored-By: TripleU <182648541+TripleU613@users.noreply.github.com>
